{"product_id":"down-and-out-down-under-geronimo-stilton-no-29","title":"Down and Out Down Under (Geronimo Stilton, No. 29)","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnter the world of Geronimo Stilton, where another funny adventure is always right around the corner. Each book is a fast-paced adventure with lively art and a unique format kids 7-10 will love.G'day, mate! I was searching for ideas for my new book, and my friend Petunia Pretty Paws knew just where to find them -- in Australia. Holey cheese, it sounded like a fabumouse adventure! But between surfing with sharks, being chased by poisonous snakes, and getting lost in the outback, I was beginning to wonder if this trip down under was really a good idea. Kangaroos and koalas and crocs -- oh, my! Would I ever see New Mouse City again?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Geronimo Stilton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780439841207\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Mass Market Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738323411097,"sku":"16RA-1-9780439841207","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d147bf66d3f_Down_and_Out_Down_Under__Geronimo_Stilton__No._29__Geronimo_Stilton.jpg?v=1758564037","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/down-and-out-down-under-geronimo-stilton-no-29","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}